  "id": "pasta-with-scallops-zucchini-and-tomatoes",
  "name": "Pasta with Scallops, Zucchini, and Tomatoes",
  "subtitle": "A bright skillet pasta with tender vegetables and scallops",
  "description": "Fettuccine is tossed with garlicky zucchini, tomatoes, basil, and scallops, then finished with Parmesan.",
